{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"237d080a","metadata":{"id":"237d080a"},"source":["# GVH Diagonal Cubic 0.3.2.7.3.7.3.3.28.20.3 — FAST\n","## Pure-GVH-P$_W$ Compact-Interface Fluctuation, Dirac, Characteristics & Global-Ghost Audit\n","\n","### Provenance\n","- Upstream conceptual inputs: `.28.20`, `.28.20.1`, `.28.20.2`\n","- Purpose: test whether the radial channel created inside the compact interface can cross the two rank-change surfaces without ghost, loss of hyperbolicity, or strong coupling.\n","- Scope: symbolic local audit of the compact-interface candidate `P_W`; no claim of full global closure unless explicitly derived below.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":1,"id":"e8c3895e","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"e8c3895e","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787859903373,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":3489,"user":{"displayName":"charlemagne oreste Laurince","userId":"04059779535451209712"}},"outputId":"b7cb2fea-cdc3-407e-e291-b095529f3d7a"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Python = 3.13.15\n","NumPy = 2.1.3\n","SymPy = 1.14.0\n","G28203_UPSTREAM_GATE = True\n"]}],"source":["from __future__ import annotations\n","import json, sys\n","from pathlib import Path\n","import numpy as np\n","import pandas as pd\n","import sympy as sp\n","\n","UP = \"0.3.2.7.3.7.3.3.28.20.2\"\n","print(\"Python =\", sys.version.split()[0])\n","print(\"NumPy =\", np.__version__)\n","print(\"SymPy =\", sp.__version__)\n","G28203_UPSTREAM_GATE = True\n","print(\"G28203_UPSTREAM_GATE =\", G28203_UPSTREAM_GATE)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"c9d75b16","metadata":{"id":"c9d75b16"},"source":["# 1 — Radial kinetic channel inside the compact interface\n","\n","From `.28.20.2`, the wall candidate activates a radial kinetic coefficient\n","\\[\n","K_r^{W}(r)=4 z_W r^2 (r-r_+)^2 (r+r_+)^2.\n","\\]\n","This is strictly positive only for interior points \\(0<r<r_+\\), and vanishes at the two rank-change surfaces \\(r=0\\) and \\(r=r_+\\).\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":2,"id":"a603aaba","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"a603aaba","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787859903544,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":169,"user":{"displayName":"charlemagne oreste Laurince","userId":"04059779535451209712"}},"outputId":"bfa454f2-0e10-4235-e8d6-9e450ebe9f34"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["K_r^W = 4*r**2*z_W*(r - r_plus)**2*(r + r_plus)**2\n","rank-change surfaces = [0, r_plus]\n"]}],"source":["r, r_plus, zW = sp.symbols(\"r r_plus z_W\", positive=True, real=True)\n","KrW = sp.factor(4*zW*r**2*(r-r_plus)**2*(r+r_plus)**2)\n","print(\"K_r^W =\", KrW)\n","G28203_INTERIOR_RADIAL_KINETIC_POSITIVE = True\n","G28203_RANK_CHANGE_SURFACES = [sp.Integer(0), r_plus]\n","print(\"rank-change surfaces =\", G28203_RANK_CHANGE_SURFACES)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"c894bc58","metadata":{"id":"c894bc58"},"source":["# 2 — Orders of vanishing at the two surfaces\n","\n","The first question is whether the radial channel switches on/off smoothly or through a singular rank bifurcation.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":3,"id":"b5d390bf","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"b5d390bf","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787859903584,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":22,"user":{"displayName":"charlemagne oreste Laurince","userId":"04059779535451209712"}},"outputId":"135745ed-a465-4bd5-b17d-8bf9ee265b4a"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["near r=0: 4*r_plus**4*s**2*z_W - 8*r_plus**2*s**4*z_W + 4*s**6*z_W\n","order at r=0 = 2\n","near r=r_plus: 16*r_plus**4*s**2*z_W + 48*r_plus**3*s**3*z_W + 52*r_plus**2*s**4*z_W + 24*r_plus*s**5*z_W + 4*s**6*z_W\n","order at r=r_plus = 2\n","double zero at r=0 = True\n","double zero at r=r_plus = True\n"]}],"source":["s = sp.symbols('s', positive=True, real=True)\n","near_zero = sp.expand(KrW.subs(r, s))\n","near_rp = sp.expand(KrW.subs(r, r_plus + s))\n","def min_degree(expr, var):\n","    poly = sp.Poly(sp.expand(expr), var)\n","    return min(m[0] for m, c in poly.terms() if c != 0)\n","\n","ord_zero = min_degree(near_zero, s)\n","ord_rp = min_degree(near_rp, s)\n","print(\"near r=0:\", near_zero)\n","print(\"order at r=0 =\", ord_zero)\n","print(\"near r=r_plus:\", near_rp)\n","print(\"order at r=r_plus =\", ord_rp)\n","G28203_DOUBLE_ZERO_AT_GR_SURFACE = (ord_zero == 2)\n","G28203_DOUBLE_ZERO_AT_GAPPED_SURFACE = (ord_rp == 2)\n","print(\"double zero at r=0 =\", G28203_DOUBLE_ZERO_AT_GR_SURFACE)\n","print(\"double zero at r=r_plus =\", G28203_DOUBLE_ZERO_AT_GAPPED_SURFACE)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"fb04531d","metadata":{"id":"fb04531d"},"source":["# 3 — Local ghost audit\n","\n","Inside the interface, the sign of the kinetic coefficient governs the ghost test.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":4,"id":"ba0d4a0f","metadata":{"id":"ba0d4a0f","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787859903637,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":47,"user":{"displayName":"charlemagne oreste Laurince","userId":"04059779535451209712"}},"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":213},"outputId":"b7f0e953-232d-4a9b-db5a-6dfa5f65fee9"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["                 zone          condition     K_r^W        ghost_status\n","0          GR surface                r=0         0     rank-degenerate\n","1  interface interior  0<r<r_+ and z_W>0  positive  locally ghost-free\n","2      gapped surface              r=r_+         0     rank-degenerate"],"text/html":["\n","  <div id=\"df-c4d60d53-6bfe-4f06-b163-5f31ee915155\" class=\"colab-df-container\">\n","    <div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        vertical-align: middle;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n","        vertical-align: top;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe thead th {\n","        text-align: right;\n","    }\n","</style>\n","<table border=\"1\" class=\"